herdr-toolkit (https://github.com/SergiyShch/herdr-toolkit), derived from herdr-sab
(https://github.com/thabti/herdr-sab, Apache License 2.0),
a layout for the Herdr app

Parts of this package are derived from Kanso (https://github.com/jlopezlira/herdr-kanso),
Copyright 2026 jlopezlira, Apache License 2.0, which is itself derived from mods
shipped with Herdr (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app, Apache License 2.0):

- toolkit/mods/toolkit-panel/{files,changes,pr,preview,lib}.js  (from kanso-panel)
- toolkit/mods/toolkit-open-with/main.js                         (from open-with)
- toolkit/mods/toolkit-panel/icons/*  (Kanso's Lucide-style set; issue/external/github/agent
  from herdr-mission-control, MIT)
- toolkit/mods/toolkit-tabs/main.js   (from Herdr's shipped `tabs` mod)

Each derived file's header says what changed. Kanso's original NOTICE is kept in NOTICE.kanso.
Ideas (self-naming tabs, Claude context readings) come from
https://github.com/CiprianSpiridon/herdr-mission-control (MIT); no code was copied from it.
